# Tilt! (levels/solo/tilt.txt): three tries at the pinball level. Format: src/capture/timeline.rs.
# 1. Hop off the perch and let the ducks do it: up A and into its spikes.
wait 0.5
hold Right Space 300ms
hold Right 0.6
# 2. Out of A's door, down R1's drain, up R2, out over R3 into the wide shaft... and in at
#    the first door: spikes.
at 5
hold Right Space 300ms
hold Right 2.6
wait 0.45
hold Right 6
# 3. The same, but sink down the wide shaft (hold Left: every bounce loses a little) and
#    turn into the bottom door: out onto the plunger.
at 16
hold Right Space 300ms
hold Right 2.6
wait 0.45
hold Right 3.5
hold Left 2.4
hold Right 2
wait 2
